   "title": "Revelation 12-22",
   "description": "The book of Revelation is not a secret code for deciphering the timeline of Jesus’ return. It’s a work of apocalyptic literature that shows how every human kingdom eventually becomes Babylon and must be resisted. Revelation prophecies that Jesus, who died for the sins of the world, will return one day as King to prompt repentance.",
   "duration": "11:51",
